{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pig Tower is a simple but challenging 2D platformer with a speedrunning twist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb towers to rescue the princess as fast as you can. Every second counts, and your best times are rewarded with Silver or Gold medals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and climb through dangerous tower stages filled with enemies and tricky jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the layouts, refine your route, and shave seconds off your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls keep the challenge fair \u2014 if you fall, it\u2019s on you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goals &amp; Progression:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer each tower and reach the final tower where the princess awaits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn medals for your clear times \u2014 can you claim gold on every level?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Steam achievements as you master the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 2D platforming with a focus on speed and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tower stages with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medal and achievement system for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pig Tower is easy to pick up but tough to master, perfect for platforming fans and speedrunners alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE for Steamdeck: Please go into properties and Force the use of Compatibility; choose Proton 9.0-4 (I don't know how to force this from the app side)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish first tow